   178	
   179	"They shoe by the tier."
   180	
   181	He picked up his box.
   182	
   183	Beyond the smith's the ground went up steeply, and one street climbed it. At its head, two hundred yards above them, stood the second wall, with an arch in it; and in the arch were two figures in long coats of that same dark blue. Cael looked at the coats. He did not look higher.
   184	
   185	Lira was looking at them too. Her right hand hung at her side, and her left was on the becket at her shoulder, and neither of them went near the breast of her coat.
   186	
