+
+Range: `manuscript/chapter-16.md` through `manuscript/chapter-30.md`.
+
+Method: every chapter below was printed in full with numbered lines and read in order. Scripts were used only after that reading for quote, asterisk, numeral, scene-break, repeated-word, and paragraph-length checks. Total coverage: fifteen chapters, eighty scenes, 76,215 words.
