+### Protected and restored units
+
+1. `manuscript/chapter-16.md`, protected clear/empty/safe line
+   - Before: `He was wet to the shins still, and he was looking down at a piece of black water the shape of a slate, as he looked at a paper that he had finished with.`
+   - Unit: `"It's clear because it's empty, not because it's safe," said Seln.`
+   - After: `The factor turned to look at him, and found nothing to dispute, and came down off the bank.`
